{{Quote|Well, I don't know about you lot, but enough with the chatter. I'm going to be the first to get my crystal and get out of here.|Petro|<ref name="The Gathering" />}}
'''Petro''' was a [[human]] [[Gender|male]] [[Jedi]] [[Jedi Initiate|youngling]] who served the [[Jedi Order]] during the [[Clone Wars]]. Prior to the end of the conflict, he participated in an ancient [[Jedi]] rite of passage, known as [[Gathering|the Gathering]], to find a [[kyber crystal]]&mdash;the key component to the [[Petro's lightsaber|lightsaber]] he would construct after his visit to the [[planet]] [[Ilum]].

==Biography==
===Early life===
Petro was [[Reproduction|born]] on [[Corellia]] and being [[Force-sensitive]], he was taken to the [[Imperial Palace|Jedi Temple]] on [[Coruscant]] to begin his [[Jedi training]] and learn the ways of [[the Force]].<ref name="Episode Gallery" />

===The Gathering===
{{Quote|A crystal you have found&mdash;water, you have brought.''"<br />"''But that's impossible! It was my crystal, I was sure of it.''"<br />"''So certain, were you? Go back, and closer you must look.|Yoda and Petro|<ref name="The Gathering" />}}
<div style="float:right">[[File:PetroHoldsCrystal-TG.png|thumb|300px|right|Petro holds his lightsaber crystal after exiting the crystal caves.]]</div>
Being amongst the top of his class, Petro was one of six [[Jedi Initiate|Jedi younglings]], along with [[Ganodi]], [[Byph]], [[Katooni]], [[Zatt]], and [[Gungi]], selected to travel to the sacred [[planet]] [[Ilum]] to take part in the ancient [[Jedi]] ritual known as [[Gathering|the Gathering]]. As he entered the [[Crystal Cave]] to search for his [[Kyber crystal|crystal]], he confidently and quickly found a crystal he believed to be his but would watch it melt in his hand as he realized he had been too quick to think he had completed the task. As he saw a trapped [[Katooni]], he began to walk away before he realized he should help her. As he helped her use the Force to shatter the wall of ice blocking her, he saw his crystal returned from the cave.<ref name="The Gathering" />

===Pirate attack===
[[File:PetroAssemblesLightsaber-AToS.png|thumb|300px|left|Petro hurriedly assembled his lightsaber incorrectly the first time.]]
Following the successful nature of the Gathering, Petro and his fellow [[youngling]]s returned to the ''[[Crucible]]'', where Petro demonstrated a technique, seemingly of his own invention that he described as the [[Whirlwind of Destiny]]. Under the guidance of Professor [[Huyang]], an [[Architect droid]] who had been teaching Jedi how to build a [[lightsaber]] for more than a thousand [[Standard year|years]]. He showed different models of lightsabers and asked them to visualize what kind of lightsaber they wanted to build so that they could complete the construction of their lightsaber. Petro was the first one to finish building [[Petro's lightsaber|his saber]] and told Zatt that with his lightsaber, he would challenge [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]] to a [[Lightsaber combat|duel]] and [[Death|kill]] [[General]] [[Grievous]]. But after Huyang examined it, He noted that the only person that Petro would kill would be himself as Petro incorrectly assembled his lightsaber because he inverted the emitter matrix which would cause the power grid to backfire. Huyang stated that if Petro tried to activate his lightsaber now that the only thing that would be left of him and his lightsaber would be his crystal. Huyang told Petro to start over and to follow the diagram.<ref name="A Test of Strength">{{TCW|A Test of Strength}}</ref>

But before Petro or any of the younglings could finish constructing their lightsaber, they were attacked by [[Hondo Ohnaka]] and his [[pirate]] [[Ohnaka Gang|gang]]. Huyang told the younglings to hand over their crystals for safekeeping, but Petro secretly kept his crystal. When they were attacked by the pirates, Petro activated his lightsaber, much to everyone's surprise, and allowed one of the pirates to take it. When if malfunctioned and exploded, the group escaped, with Petro reclaiming his crystal. Despite their efforts, [[Ahsoka Tano]] was taken by the pirates and brought to their base on [[Florrum]].<ref name="A Test of Strength" />

===Rescuing Ahsoka Tano===
[[File:InitiatesCircusAudition-BFR.png|thumb|300px|right|Petro and the other Younglings audition for Preigo's circus.]]
Petro and the other younglings were left onboard the damaged ''Crucible''. Katooni decided to try to make contact with someone, and she was able to reach Master Kenobi. He told the younglings to wait for him as he was about to engage Grievous and his fleet. Petro voiced his wishes to try to help Ahsoka themselves, and although Katooni did not agree, many of the others did. They then headed towards Florrum to mount a rescue mission. Upon landing, Ganodi decided to stay with Huyang to work on repairs as the others ventured off towards the pirate base.<ref name="Bound for Rescue" />

Petro and the others soon met [[Preigo's Traveling World of Wonder|Preigo's circus]], who were traveling towards the pirate camp to perform for them. Petro took the lead, telling [[Preigo]] that they were acrobats, and after using their Force abilities to impress the [[Dug]], he let them join his act. They then traveled with the circus to Hondo's base and successfully rescued Ahsoka.<ref name="Bound for Rescue" />

===Duel in the Temple===
{{Quote|Look out!|Petro to Anakin Skywalker|<ref name="The Wrong Jedi">{{TCW|The Wrong Jedi}}</ref>}}
[[File:JediTempleTrainingGround-TWJ.png|thumb|300px|left|Petro trains under Master Sinube's guidance with other younglings at the Jedi Temple.]]
Petro, along with some of his fellow younglings were outside of the temple training with their lightsabers under [[Jedi Master]] [[Tera Sinube]], when they witnessed a duel between [[Anakin Skywalker]] and [[Barriss Offee]], who was the real culprit behind the [[Bombing of the Jedi Temple hangar]] and the framing of Ahsoka Tano. When Barriss kicked Anakin off the roof of a building they were dueling on, he fell to where the younglings were training. Master Sinube immediately activated his lightsaber to defend himself and the younglings if need be. Petro quickly warned Anakin to look out when Barriss leaped down to strike at Anakin. Anakin was able then to defeat Barriss and take her into custody.<ref name="The Wrong Jedi" />

===Vision to Yoda===
Yoda was given trials by the [[Force Priestesses]] when he went to the [[Wellspring of Life]]. One trial was in the [[Valley of Extinction]], where Yoda saw two scenarios. In the first [[Force vision|vision]], Yoda was inside the Jedi Temple, where he found Petro and [[Mace Windu]]'s corpses, as well as Tano's dying body. In the second vision, Yoda was shown an idealistic version of the Jedi Order. Yoda saw Petro run by him smiling, as he chased other younglings across the [[Jedi Temple training ground]]. Soon after, Jedi Master [[Dooku]] invited Yoda to join Petro and the other Jedi on the other side of the training ground. However, Yoda soon determined the images he saw were all illusions.<ref name="Destiny">{{TCW|Destiny (The Clone Wars)}}</ref>

==Personality and traits==
[[File:Petro-TCWCEJtB.png|thumb|250px|right|Petro constructed his lightsaber which emitted a blue blade.]]
Petro was a human (Corellian) male Jedi youngling<ref name="The Gathering" /> who stood at 1.26 [[meter]]s (4 [[Foot|feet]], 2 inches) tall.<ref name="Join the Battle" /> He had [[Color|black]] [[hair]], green [[eye]]s and tan skin.<ref name="The Gathering" /> Petro dreamed of proving himself to be a great Jedi warrior and his competitive streak frequently annoyed the other younglings in his clan.<ref name="Join the Battle" /> He rushed through the construction of his lightsaber before any other youngling completed their sabers. In the process, Petro incorrectly assembled the pieces, as he inverted the emitter matrix which would have caused the power grid to backfire. As a result, Professor Huyang instructed the youngling to restart while following the diagram,<ref name="A Test of Strength" /> reminding Petro it was important to follow directions during Jedi traditions.<ref name="Join the Battle" />

==Skills and abilities==
Petro was known for his [[Force-sensitive|Force-sensitivity]] and dreamed of proving himself as a great Jedi warrior. He also was skilled in lightsaber combat.<ref name="Join the Battle" />

==Equipment==
Petro wore standard [[Jedi apparel|Jedi robes]]<ref name="The Gathering" /> and wielded a blue lightsaber.<ref name="A Test of Strength" />

==Behind the scenes==
Petro first appeared in "[[The Gathering (episode)|The Gathering]]," the sixth episode of ''[[Star Wars: The Clone Wars]]'' [[The Clone Wars: Season Five|fifth season]].<ref name="Explore: The Gathering">{{SW|url=series/clone-wars/the-gathering-episode-guide|text="The Gathering" Episode Guide &#124; The Clone Wars}}</ref> He was voiced by [[Jeff Fischer]].<ref name="The Gathering" />

